    <h2>The Rise of Family-Friendly Fine Dining</h2>
    <p>In recent years, there has been a significant shift towards making fine dining more accessible and enjoyable for families. Many Michelin-starred chefs and restaurateurs have recognized the importance of catering to families with young children, and have responded by creating menus that are both delicious and kid-friendly.</p>

    <h2>Best Family Restaurants in Asia</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Amber Restaurant & Bar (Singapore)</strong></li>
        <p>This Michelin-starred restaurant has a dedicated kids' menu, with dishes such as pasta with marinara sauce and grilled chicken skewers. The restaurant also offers a family-friendly atmosphere, with comfortable seating and a relaxed vibe.</p>

      <li><strong>Gaggan (Bangkok, Thailand)</strong></li>
        <p>This three-Michelin-starred restaurant has a unique kids' menu that features dishes such as chicken tikka masala and veggie burgers. The restaurant also offers a family-friendly atmosphere, with spacious seating areas and a kid's play area.</p>

